e talk!</span></p></div><span class=\"boot-screen-index\">Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"page-transition-frame\"></div><span class=\"page-transition-mark\">L</span></div><div class=\"site site--loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link site-nav-mobile-link--active\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/reviews\"><span>Reviews</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>07</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>08</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><main class=\"editorial-page page-communities\"><section class=\"editorial-hero communities-hero\"><div class=\"editorial-hero-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Fox Cities communities</p></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"editorial-hero-title\">Find the community<em>that fits your life.</em></h1></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-hero-description\">Every Fox Cities community has its own rhythm. We help you look beyond a listing and understand the day-to-day details that shape where home feels right.</p></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/contact\">Talk through your search</a></div></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">F</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-footnote\"><span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span><span class=\"editorial-hero-footnote-line\"></span><span>Local perspective</span></div></section><section class=\"communities-intro\"><div class=\"communities-intro-aside\"><span class=\"editorial-section-number\">01 — Explore locally</span><span class=\"communities-intro-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span></div><div class=\"communities-intro-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>More than a map pin</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">The right address starts<em>with the right context.</em></h2></div><div class=\"communities-intro-copy\"><p>From Appleton and Neenah to Menasha, Kaukauna, Kimberly, Little Chute, Greenville, and Oshkosh, the Fox Cities offer a range of ways to live—quiet streets, walkable cores, newer development, established neighborhoods, and everything in between.</p><p>We will talk through schools, commute times, resale history, and local amenities so you can decide with a fuller picture of what each area offers.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"communities-directory\"><div class=\"communities-directory-heading\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Where we work</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">Communities at<em>a glance.</em></h2></div><div class=\"editorial-community-grid\"><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--appleton\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">01</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">A</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">The center of the Fox Cities</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>01</span></div><h2>Appleton</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">A dynamic mix of established neighborhoods and newer developments, with a strong downtown core and easy access to shopping, dining, and schools.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--neenah\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">02</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">N</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">Waterfront character</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>02</span></div><h2>Neenah</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Waterfront charm and established neighborhoods, with convenient access to commuting routes and local amenities.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--menasha\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">03</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">M</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">A balanced pace</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>03</span></div><h2>Menasha</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Historic homes, quiet streets, and proximity to both Appleton and Neenah, offering a balanced pace of life.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--kaukauna\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">04</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">K</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">Growing with character</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>04</span></div><h2>Kaukauna</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Growing neighborhoods with a small-town feel and easy access to the Fox River and regional employers.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--kimberly\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">05</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">K</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">A close-knit community</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>05</span></div><h2>Kimberly</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Tight-knit community with well-regarded schools and convenient access to Appleton.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--little-chute\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">06</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">L</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">Quietly connected</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>06</span></div><h2>Little Chute</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Affordable neighborhoods with a quiet atmosphere and quick access to nearby cities.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--greenville\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">07</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">G</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">Room to grow</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>07</span></div><h2>Greenville</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Newer developments, larger lots, and a blend of rural feel with modern conveniences.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-community-card\"><div class=\"editorial-community-visual editorial-community-visual--oshkosh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"editorial-community-index\">08</span><span class=\"editorial-community-initial\">O</span><div class=\"editorial-community-frame\"></div><span class=\"editorial-community-descriptor\">Lakefront energy</span></div><div class=\"editorial-community-card-content\"><div class=\"editorial-community-card-header\"><p>Fox Cities</p><span>08</span></div><h2>Oshkosh</h2><p class=\"editorial-community-blurb\">Lakefront access, university-town energy, and a mix of historic and newer housing options.</p><span class=\"editorial-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"communities-guidance\"><div class=\"communities-guidance-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">L</div><div class=\"communities-guidance-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow editorial-eyebrow--light\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Let’s narrow it down</p><h2>Not sure where<em>to begin?</em></h2><p>Tell us what matters most to you. We will help you compare the right areas and build a thoughtful starting point for your Fox Cities search.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p><strong>Shane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></p><p><strong>Oliver Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19208584424\">(920) 858-4424</a></p></address></div><div class=\"footer-map\"><div class=\"footer-map-header\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Office location</p><span>Appleton, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"footer-map-frame\"><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2857.210069477556!2d-88.46770222396349!3d44.26449767107976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8803b7a5ba3b6f2d%3A0x6b0d2f80904d9e2f!2sKeller%20Williams%20Fox%20Cities!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1788252496599!5m2!1sen!2sin\" title=\"Keller Williams Fox Cities office location in Appleton, Wisconsin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0\" allowFullScreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div></div></div><div class=\"site-footer-compliance\"><div class=\"footer-kw\"><div class=\"footer-kw-heading\"><p>Keller Williams Fox Cities